---
title: We made search JSON 2.7x faster. Nobody will notice, and that's fine
date: 2026-11-18
summary: Swapping Go's standard JSON encoder for moego on our search pages cut encoding time from 504 µs to 184 µs per page on the production CPU. Here is how we measured it, why the site is not visibly faster, and where we kept the old encoder on purpose.
type: article
tags:
